Tool for sending out personal feedback/notes after practice performances.

Need to provide the following:

1) Slack Bot Token in token.env (SLACK_BOT_TOKEN=######)
2) name_list.json ({"name": "AAAAAAAAA", "name2": "BBBBBBBBB"})

The slack bot needs to be invited to the workspace you want this bot to work in and have read/write permissions.
